    "heading": "Access real-time tax lien and tax deed auction listings",
    "html": "<section class=\"section_home_feature\"><div class=\"home_feature_component\"><div id=\"w-node-_911cb961-9b3f-cb66-3535-2ddd9101b99a-16e39109\" class=\"home_feature_content-left\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-xsmall\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615e00fafadb063161d86614/67e708672a59b9f01a9c6412_Benefits.png\" alt></div><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-small\"><h2 class=\"heading-2\">Access real-time tax lien and tax deed auction listings</h2></div><p class=\"text-size-medium\">Discover the most up-to-date tax sale auction and parcel data, gain a competitive edge in the tax sale market and access premium pricing through your Ted Thomas referral.</p><div class=\"margin-top margin-medium\"><div class=\"div-block-25 more-margin\"><a href=\"https://www.taxsaleresources.com/ted-thomas-exclusive#pricing\" class=\"nav-link get-started-button main-call-to-action lighthouse w-button\">Try Today for Free!</a></div></div></div><div class=\"home_feature_content-right\"><div class=\"home_feature_card\"><div class=\"home_feature_card-content\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-medium\"><div class=\"home_feature_image-wrapper\"><img alt src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615e00fafadb063161d86614/67e70beecf0299d0d2f052cd_Parcel%20Page.png\" class=\"home_feature_image\"></div></div><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-xsmall\"><h3 class=\"heading-style-h5\">Comprehensive property information</h3></div><p>Our web application provides comprehensive property information and analysis tools to help you make informed investment decisions.</p></div></div><div class=\"home_feature_card white\"><div class=\"home_feature_card-content\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-medium\"><div class=\"home_feature_image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"Tax Sale Resources nationwide tax lien and tax deed search\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615e00fafadb063161d86614/62b5f96c583276885c002551_Advanced%20Search.webp\" class=\"home_feature_image\"></div></div><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-xsmall\"><h3 class=\"heading-style-h5\">Advanced search filters and interactive mapping</h3></div><p>Utilize our advanced search filters and interactive map to find the perfect tax lien and tax deed properties that align with your investment strategy.</p></div></div><div class=\"home_feature_card\"><div class=\"home_feature_card-content\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-medium\"><div class=\"home_feature_image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"Extended database feature\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615e00fafadb063161d86614/62b5fe48a9616a75befc06e3_Extended%20Dataset.webp\" class=\"home_feature_image\"></div></div><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-xsmall\"><h3 class=\"heading-style-h5\">Extended datasets </h3></div><p>Stop evaluating your tax sale investments without all the needed information. Use <strong>Tax Sale Resources</strong> to ensure there aren't any known environmental hazards, or other high risk issues.</p></div></div><div class=\"home_feature_card white\"><div class=\"home_feature_card-content\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-medium\"><div class=\"home_feature_image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"Built in ancillary service offering for Tax Sale Resources - Research\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615e00fafadb063161d86614/62b5fdbb9cd58ab3f3767823_Ancillary%20Services.webp\" class=\"home_feature_image\"></div></div><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-xsmall\"><h3 class=\"heading-style-h5\">A team of professionals at your fingertips</h3></div><p>One click for title searches, drive-by inspections, detailed analysis or a comps report on tax sale parcels nationwide.</p></div></div></div></div></section>",
