    "heading": "How to find and invest in tax sale properties with ease",
    "html": "<section class=\"section_home_how-it-works-1\"><div class=\"padding-global\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div class=\"padding-section-large\"><div class=\"home_how-it-works-1_component\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-xxlarge\"><div class=\"max-width-large\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-xsmall\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615e00fafadb063161d86614/67e70853f707c4220d9416a4_Process.png\" alt></div><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-small\"><h2 class=\"heading-2\">How to find and invest in tax sale properties with ease</h2></div><p class=\"text-size-medium\">Our research application provides investors with detailed data to easily research and view tax sale properties. With our user-friendly interface, finding the perfect investment opportunity has never been easier. And through your Ted Thomas referral, you can unlock exclusive yearly pricing to access our services whenever you need them.</p></div></div><div class=\"w-layout-grid home_how-it-works-1_list\"><div class=\"home_how-it-works-1_item\"><div class=\"text-span-step\"><strong>STEP 1</strong></div><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-small\"><h3 class=\"heading-style-h4 number-1\">Sign-up for a <span class=\"text-span-light-background\"><br>Free Trial</span></h3></div><p>Click on any \"Try Today for Free!\" button to quickly create your account. <em>(Be sure to confirm your email after sign-up!)</em></p></div><div class=\"home_how-it-works-1_item\"><div class=\"text-span-step\"><strong>STEP 2</strong></div><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-small\"><h3 class=\"heading-style-h4\">Analyze the available opportunities</h3></div><p>We make analyzing opportunities easy! Quickly see the needed property information on opportunities in your desired market to ensure you are making informed investment decisions.</p></div><div class=\"home_how-it-works-1_item\"><div class=\"text-span-step\"><strong>STEP 3</strong></div><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-small\"><h3 class=\"heading-style-h4\">Keep or Cancel your membership</h3></div><p>Evaluate our platform for FREE! If you like it, great! If not, no problem at all, you can <strong>one click cancel from within the application</strong>!</p></div></div><div class=\"margin-top margin-xlarge\"><div class=\"div-block-25 more-margin\"><a href=\"https://www.taxsaleresources.com/ted-thomas-exclusive#pricing\" class=\"nav-link get-started-button main-call-to-action lighthouse w-button\">Try Today for Free!</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>",
